  "description": "Optional companion module for SafeWebCore that validates the JWT authentication\n      authority at startup. Detects a misconfigured or unreachable OpenID Connect authority\n      (for example a typo such as \"organisations\") with a loud log or a fail-fast startup,\n      instead of a silent 100% 401 availability incident.",
