  "releaseNotes": "## v1.0.1 — Dependency maintenance\n\nMaintenance patch. **100% backwards compatible** — no public API or behavior change.\n\n- `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authentication.JwtBearer` dependency updated from 10.0.11 to 10.0.12, so the package now requires that patch or newer\n- Packaging parity with core and `SafeWebCore.FraudDetection`: the package now ships a `.snupkg` symbol package with SourceLink and deterministic builds, and embeds these release notes in the nuspec. This is the first JwtBearer version to carry the badge-corrected packaged `README.md`\n\nSee CHANGELOG.md and docs/ for full details.",
